title Cassette: no sound input found: the empty window with the message, REC dimmed, no CARD stepper
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO noinput
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot noinput
expect text "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect text "Found by itself when plugged in."
expect notext "CARD"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
